
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
    <title>Grand Survey expedition

    </title>
    <style>
        :root{
            --bg: #41a5e7;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --card-border: #000000;
            --radius: 12px;
            --max-width: 900px;
            --accent: #0b5ea8;
        }
        html,body{
            height:100%;
            margin:0;
        }
        body{
            display:flex;
            align-items:center;
            justify-content:center;
            background:var(--bg);
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
            color:#000;
            -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
            -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
            padding:2rem;
            box-sizing:border-box;
        }
        .card{
            background:var(--card-bg);
            border:2px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius:var(--radius);
            padding:2rem;
            max-width:var(--max-width);
            width:100%;
            box-sizing:border-box;
            line-height:1.5;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }
        .card p{ margin:0 0 1rem 0; }
        .links a{ color:var(--accent); text-decoration:underline; }
        .actions{ margin-top:1.25rem; display:flex; gap:0.75rem; align-items:center; }
        .btn{
            display:inline-block;
            background:#000;
            color:#fff;
            border:0;
            padding:0.6rem 1rem;
            border-radius:8px;
            text-decoration:none;
            font-weight:600;
            cursor:pointer;
        }
        @media (max-width:520px){
            .card{ padding:1.25rem; border-radius:10px; }
            .btn{ width:100%; text-align:center; }
            .actions{ flex-direction:column; align-items:stretch; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main class="card" role="main" aria-labelledby="title">
        <h1 id="title" style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0.75rem;font-size:1.25rem;">The Grand Survey Expedition</h1>
        <p>
            The Grand Survey expedition was a month long experiment ran by
            <a class="links" href="https://hackclub.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hack Club</a>
            as part of the
            <a class="links" href="https://summer.hackclub.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Summer Of Making</a>.
            Participants each created a web page based on a description for a scene on an island. All the pages had neighbouring pages and linked together, making the island home to 100 web pages that could be navigated accross like a point and click adventure game.
        </p>
        <p>
            By the end of the survey we had mapped out the island in full, which you can check out here!
            The code is also <a class="links" href="http://github.com/hackclub/som-grand-survey-expedition/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">open source</a>.
        </p>

        <div class="actions">
            <a class="btn" href="/scenes">Browse the island</a>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
